<Placemark><name>4. 알무데나 대성당 (본당)</name><description><![CDATA[🕒 13:30 ~ 14:00<br>도보 3분 · 본당 무료<br>[무료]]]></description><styleUrl>#p_mad</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-3.7144,40.4157,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
